          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thus he shewed me: and, behold, the Lord stood upon a wall",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "made",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "by a plumbline, with a plumbline in his hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto me, Amos, what seest thou? And I said, A plumbline. Then said the Lord, Behold, I will set a plumbline in the midst of my people Israel: I will not again pass by them any more:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the high places of Isaac shall be desolate, and the sanctuaries of Israel shall be laid waste; and I will rise against the house of Jeroboam with the sword.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Then Amaziah the priest of Beth-el sent to Jeroboam king of Israel, saying, Amos hath conspired against thee in the midst of the house of Israel: the land is not able to bear all his words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thus Amos saith, Jeroboam shall die by the sword, and Israel shall surely be led away captive out of their own land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also Amaziah said unto Amos, O thou seer, go, flee thee away into the land of Judah, and there eat bread, and prophesy there:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But prophesy not again any more at Beth-el: for it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the king's chapel, and it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "AMO.7.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the king's court.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
